DESCRIPTION:Kick off the holidays with the BSO’s much-loved Celebrate the S
 eason concert at Spencer’s historic Tivoli Theatre!\n\nAre you ready to cel
 ebrate the season with the Bloomington Symphony Orchestra?\n\nPopcorn? Chec
 k.\nComfy chair? Check.\nLights turned down low? Check.\nThat special feeli
 ng of quiet anticipation you get when you hear music from your favorite hol
 iday films? Check!Music from the Movies is the theme of this year’s festive
  holiday celebration. \n\n\nOrder tickets online HERE\, through  Tivoli The
 atre box office.\n\n$15 adults\n$5 child/student
