BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Symphony
DTSTART:20261127T130000Z
DTEND:20261209T050000Z
DTSTAMP:20261128T072847Z
UID:6121-1795766400-1796774400@www.bloomingtonsymphony.com
URL:https://www.bloomingtonsymphony.com/event/window-of-giving/
CREATED:20261127T062624Z
DESCRIPTION:Dear friend of the BSO: \nWe at the Bloomington Symphony Orches
 tra wish you a joyful start to the holiday season! As President of the Boar
 d\, I am so proud of everything this big-hearted little orchestra does. As 
 you know\, the BSO is made up almost entirely of volunteers\, and even with
  our efforts to keep expenses low\, the truth remains that we cannot bring 
 our community the great events you have come to expect from us without your
  ongoing support. \nSo\, welcome to our Window of Giving fund drive! From t
 he first Celebrate the Season concert on November 27\, until the final conc
 ert at the Tivoli on December 8\, we are asking for you to show your suppor
 t for the BSO. \nOur goal for this drive is $5\,700\, in honor of our 57th 
 season. Anyone who donates during this fund drive can choose from one-of-a-
 kind perks (see reverse) that are only offered during this drive. In additi
 on to these special perks\, your donations will continue to support the BSO
 ’s mission to bring extraordinary performances to our community. \nBut wait
 \, there’s more! To prove that we support the BSO as much as you do\, I hav
 e joined with several of our past Board Presidents to offer you the Preside
 nts’ Challenge to double the impact of your donation! We will match the fir
 st $1\,500 donated to this fund drive\, bringing us more than halfway to ou
 r total goal. \nPlease join us and give as generously as you can. We always
  say “We really couldn’t do it without you\,” and that is as true now as it
  was when the orchestra started\, back in 1969. \nGratefully\, \nAlexis L. 
 Witt\nPhD\, Musicology\nBloomington Symphony Orchestra\nPresident to the Bo
 ard of Directors\n  \nPick a Perk –\nYou chose to support us\, so the least
  we can do is offer you a choice of special “thank you” perks at each donat
 ion level! \nAt the $75 level choose from: a BSO t-shirt or a signed concer
 t poster\nAt the $150 level choose from: A personalized ad in a future prog
 ram\, or a “section selfie” taken with your favorite section of the orchest
 ra\nAt the $300 level choose from: One of four special ringtones/sound-effe
 cts recorded by our own musicians (spooky\, sublime\, or just plain silly!)
 \nAt the $500 level choose from: A special photo op onstage with the BSO or
  a chance to sit in with the section of your choice for a rehearsal\nAt the
  $750 level choose from: A 58th season ticket or coffee/tea with our conduc
 tor\nAt the $1\,000 level choose from: Two 58th season tickets or a conduct
 ing lesson plus the chance to conduct the BSO in rehearsal \n  \n\n\n\n…plu
 s\, for every $5 you donate\, your name is entered into a drawing for a FRE
 E Season Ticket to for our 58th Season! \n\n\n\n  \n  \n 
LAST-MODIFIED:20261127T074628Z
